---
// The old /account stub is now /dashboard. Anything already linking here — a
// bookmark, an old email, the site nav before it was updated — lands on the
// real thing instead of a dead page.
//
// A meta refresh rather than a server redirect: this site builds statically to
// Cloudflare Pages, so there is no server here to answer with a 301.
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Your account · Aunt Mabel</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/dashboard" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/dashboard" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Your account has moved. <a href="/dashboard">Go to your dashboard</a>.</p>
    <script>
      // Fires immediately; the meta refresh above is the fallback for anyone
      // with JavaScript off. replace() keeps /account out of the back button,
      // so "back" from the dashboard doesn't bounce them straight forward again.
      window.location.replace('/dashboard');
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
